  m_Name: tutorial_farming2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  id: tutorial_farming2
  title: Farming (2/2)
  body: 'To harvest, walk the farmer onto a crop tile and run a Harvest block in
    the code runner.


    Harvesting mature crops will add that crop''s resource
    directly to your inventory. Immature crops can still be harvested, although it
    won''t yield anything. Track what you''ve harvested by paying attention to your
    resource count at the top of the screen.


    When you harvest a crop, its tile
    will revert to normal, so you''ll need to replant the crop if you want to harvest
    multiple times.'
  trigger: 2
  thresholdResource: 0
  thresholdAmount: 0
